@* ================================================================
   Shared Tailwind "ui-*" component kit (buttons, cards, alerts,
   modals, badges, forms, tables, etc.).

   This used to hold a runtime <style type="text/tailwindcss"> block,
   compiled in-browser by the Tailwind Play CDN script. That's now
   precompiled ahead of time with the Tailwind CLI into
   wwwroot/css/tailwind-built.css (see the build inputs in
   tailwind.config.js / tailwind-input.css at the repo root), which
   both _Layout.cshtml and _AuthLayout.cshtml link directly — so this
   partial no longer needs to emit anything itself. It's kept as an
   empty placeholder (rather than deleted) so the existing
   <partial name="_UiKitStyles" /> includes in both of those layouts
   keep working without an edit to remove them.
   ================================================================ *@
